# The course's Google OAuth client ID — PUBLIC by design: it names the app, it proves nothing.
# Your TA fills this in before the lab is released (section 01 of the OAuth lab doc).
# It must be the same value as app.google.client-id in your Spring Boot backend.
# Don't put secrets in this file: everything VITE_* ends up in the JavaScript sent to the browser.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
